Scope note (read this, it matters)

The MIT license above covers the original work in this repository: the shell /
PowerShell / Python scripts under engineering/scripts/, the documentation,
the checklists and the tables written for this project.

It does NOT cover the firmware binaries under engineering/firmware/. Those are
third-party artifacts redistributed unmodified; their copyright and licensing
belong to their respective upstream projects. See README.md section 9 and
engineering/firmware/SOURCES.md for the per-file provenance and license status
of every binary. In particular:

  - OpenWrt images are GPL-2.0 (source: https://git.openwrt.org/openwrt/openwrt.git)
  - Breed binaries are published by their author (hackpascal) as free-to-use
    binaries; no public source tree or explicit open-source license is published
    by the author, so this repository makes no license claim over them
  - The Xiaomi stock firmware image is (c) Xiaomi and is archived here solely
    for rollback / unbrick purposes

If you are a rights holder and want an artifact removed, open an issue and it
will be taken down.

